# Allowlist build context: the image build needs exactly what
# `cargo build --release --locked --bin toolu-runner` needs. Everything
# else (git history, docs, target/, CI, scripts) stays out so context
# uploads are small and unrelated edits never bust the build cache.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
crates/**/target/
